#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--batch_size`"
msgstr "`--batch_size`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`32`"
msgstr "`32`"

msgid ""
"Number of sampled observation/action windows per GPU process in an update. Larger batches usually"
" need more memory. With the shown distributed launch, effective batch is this value multiplied by"
" the number of GPU processes."
msgstr ""
"Update 한 번에서 GPU process마다 sampling하는 observation/action window 수입니다. Batch가 크면 보통 memory가 더 "
"필요합니다. 제시한 distributed 실행의 effective batch는 이 값에 GPU process 수를 곱한 값입니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--steps`"
msgstr "`--steps`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`20000`"
msgstr "`20000`"

msgid ""
"Number of optimizer updates, not episodes or robot control steps. Batch size and updates together"
" determine how many training windows are sampled, including repeats. More updates can also "
"overfit a small dataset."
msgstr ""
"Episode나 robot control step이 아닌 optimizer update 수입니다. Batch size와 함께 반복을 포함한 sampled training "
"window 수를 결정하며, 작은 dataset에서는 과도한 update가 overfitting을 유발할 수 있습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--use_policy_training_preset`"
msgstr "`--use_policy_training_preset`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`true`"
msgstr "`true`"

msgid ""
"Selects the GR00T optimizer and learning-rate schedule. The command leaves these to the pinned "
"implementation; inspect the saved run configuration when reproducing a result."
msgstr ""
"GR00T optimizer와 learning-rate schedule을 선택합니다. 고정된 구현의 preset을 사용하므로 재현 시 저장된 run configuration을"
" 확인하세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.optimizer_lr`"
msgstr "`--policy.optimizer_lr`"

msgid "Not overridden; preset default `1e-4` in LeRobot `v0.6.0`"
msgstr "Override 없음. LeRobot `v0.6.0` preset 기본값 `1e-4`"

msgid ""
"Sets the peak learning rate used by the preset optimizer. It controls update scale together with "
"the optimizer and schedule. It is not a robot speed setting."
msgstr "Preset optimizer의 peak learning rate입니다. Optimizer와 schedule과 함께 update 크기를 정하며 robot 속도 설정이 아닙니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.tune_visual`"
msgstr "`--policy.tune_visual`"

msgid "`false` in the base example; `true` in the vision-unfreezing example"
msgstr "기본 예시 `false`, vision-unfreezing 예시 `true`"

msgid ""
"Controls whether training updates the vision encoder. Unfreezing adds trainable parameters and "
"GPU memory use; test whether it improves rollout performance on your data."
msgstr ""
"Vision encoder를 학습할지 결정합니다. Unfreezing은 trainable parameter와 GPU memory 사용을 늘립니다. 본인 data의 "
"rollout 성능이 좋아지는지 시험하세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.tune_llm`"
msgstr "`--policy.tune_llm`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

msgid "Keeps the language backbone frozen. This is independent of the vision encoder setting."
msgstr "Language backbone을 frozen 상태로 유지합니다. Vision encoder 설정과는 독립적입니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--dataset.image_transforms.enable`"
msgstr "`--dataset.image_transforms.enable`"

msgid ""
"Applies training-time image augmentation to vary visual inputs. It complements simulation domain "
"randomization; it does not create additional motion demonstrations."
msgstr ""
"학습 중 image augmentation으로 시각 입력을 변화시킵니다. Simulation Domain Randomization을 보완하지만 motion "
"demonstration이 새로 생기지는 않습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.chunk_size` / `--policy.n_action_steps`"
msgstr "`--policy.chunk_size` / `--policy.n_action_steps`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`16` / `16`"
msgstr "`16` / `16`"

msgid ""
"Configures the action window and policy return limit. Longer temporal targets change the learning"
" problem; keep training and deployment configuration compatible."
msgstr ""
"Action window와 policy 반환 길이의 한계를 설정합니다. 긴 temporal target은 학습 문제를 바꾸므로 training과 deployment 설정의 "
"호환성을 유지하세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.use_relative_actions` / `--policy.relative_exclude_joints`"
msgstr "`--policy.use_relative_actions` / `--policy.relative_exclude_joints`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`true` / `'[\"gripper\"]'`"
msgstr "`true` / `'[\"gripper\"]'`"

msgid ""
"Expresses arm targets relative to the observation state while retaining absolute gripper targets."
" Deployment must use the matching saved processors."
msgstr ""
"Arm target은 observation state에 상대적으로 표현하고 gripper target은 absolute로 유지합니다. 배포 시 같은 저장 processor를 "
"사용해야 합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.embodiment_tag`"
msgstr "`--policy.embodiment_tag`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`new_embodiment`"
msgstr "`new_embodiment`"

msgid ""
"Selects the embodiment configuration for this adaptation. This is a model/data configuration "
"choice, not a performance tuning knob."
msgstr "적응할 embodiment configuration을 선택합니다. Model/data 구성 선택이며 성능 조정용 knob가 아닙니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.use_bf16`"
msgstr "`--policy.use_bf16`"

msgid ""
"Enables BF16 autocast for supported computation. It can reduce compute memory and improve "
"throughput; it does not imply every model or optimizer tensor is stored in BF16."
msgstr ""
"지원되는 연산에 BF16 autocast를 사용합니다. 연산 memory를 줄이고 throughput을 높일 수 있지만 모든 model·optimizer tensor가 "
"BF16으로 저장된다는 뜻은 아닙니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--seed`"
msgstr "`--seed`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`42`"
msgstr "`42`"

msgid ""
"Controls seeded randomness for repeatable comparisons. A fixed seed does not guarantee identical "
"results across GPU counts or software versions."
msgstr "반복 비교를 위한 seeded randomness를 제어합니다. 고정 seed라도 GPU 수나 software 버전이 달라지면 동일 결과를 보장하지 않습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--save_checkpoint` / `--save_freq`"
msgstr "`--save_checkpoint` / `--save_freq`"

