#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--log_freq` / `--wandb.enable`"
msgstr "`--log_freq` / `--wandb.enable`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`10` / `true`"
msgstr "`10` / `true`"

msgid ""
"Controls reporting cadence and experiment tracking. These make runs easier to compare; they do "
