msgstr "Report 주기와 experiment tracking을 정합니다. Run 비교를 돕지만 training objective는 바꾸지 않습니다."

msgid "Suggested example"
msgstr "권장 예시"

msgid "What it controls"
msgstr "제어 대상"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.chunk_size`"
msgstr "`--policy.chunk_size`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`16`"
msgstr "`16`"

msgid ""
"Length of the future action target window used for training, within the base model's supported "
"horizon. Changing the training window calls for a new training experiment."
msgstr "Base model이 지원하는 horizon 안에서 미래 action target window의 길이를 정합니다. Window를 바꾸려면 새 학습 실험이 필요합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--policy.n_action_steps`"
msgstr "`--policy.n_action_steps`"

msgid "`16` in the base training example and all real rollouts"
msgstr "기본 학습 예시와 모든 실제 rollout에서 `16`"

msgid ""
"Caps the action sequence returned by this LeRobot policy. It must not exceed `chunk_size`; the "
"base checkpoint can impose a further limit."
msgstr ""
"LeRobot policy가 반환하는 action sequence 길이를 제한합니다. `chunk_size`를 넘을 수 없고 base checkpoint가 추가 제한을 둘 수"
