#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`lerobot_eval --action_horizon`"
msgstr "`lerobot_eval --action_horizon`"

msgid ""
"Number of returned actions the simulation server supplies to the client. The synchronous client "
"drains its queue before requesting a fresh prediction. It cannot obtain more actions than the "
"policy returns."
msgstr ""
"Simulation server가 client에 제공하는 반환 action 수입니다. Synchronous client는 queue를 비운 뒤 새 예측을 요청하며, "
"policy 반환 수보다 많은 action을 받을 수 없습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--inference.type` / `--inference.rtc.enabled`"
msgstr "`--inference.type` / `--inference.rtc.enabled`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`rtc` / `false`"
msgstr "`rtc` / `false`"

msgid ""
"Uses the real rollout's background chunk-inference engine with RTC compensation disabled. "
"Selecting this engine does not enable compensation by itself."
msgstr ""
"RTC compensation을 끈 채 실제 rollout의 background chunk-inference engine을 사용합니다. Engine 선택만으로 "
"compensation이 켜지지는 않습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`--inference.rtc.execution_horizon` / `--inference.queue_threshold`"
msgstr "`--inference.rtc.execution_horizon` / `--inference.queue_threshold`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "`16` / `0`"
msgstr "`16` / `0`"

msgid ""
"RTC overlap-prefix setting and queue refill trigger, matching the current real-rollout recipe. "
"The RTC value does not set the number of actions executed; `policy.n_action_steps=16` sets the "
"policy return limit. RTC compensation is disabled in this recipe."
msgstr ""
"현재 real-rollout recipe의 RTC overlap-prefix와 queue refill trigger 설정입니다. RTC 값은 실행 action 수를 정하지 "
"않습니다. `policy.n_action_steps=16`이 policy 반환 길이를 정합니다. 이 recipe에서는 RTC compensation이 꺼져 있습니다."

msgid ""
"We won't have time to train during the workshop, so we'll use prepared checkpoints. These "
"instructions are for trying post-training afterward."
msgstr "Workshop 중에는 학습 시간이 부족하므로 준비된 checkpoint를 사용합니다. 이 안내는 이후 post-training을 직접 진행할 때 사용하세요."

msgid "Training instructions for later"
msgstr "추후 실습용 학습 안내"

